{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/TitelKelin600.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your transport empire on land, water and in the air! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerFahrzeuge.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build trucks, buses, ships, planes, trains, trams, maglevs, helicopter and zeppelins to transport goods and passengers between industry buildings and cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Renew your transport vehicles and replace them with better versions. Manufactories will offer you exclusive and special vehicle variants which will give you benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Fahrzeuge.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerForschung.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can research vehicle improvements to increase the efficiency of your vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Research.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerTycoon.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way up and reach the rank Tycoon. Unlock new gameplay features with each rank, finally become mayor of a city and apply for political offices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerPrestige.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you become the mayor of a city, you can build a prestige project and win the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Prestigeprojekt.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerHead.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a company headquarters foundation and gradually expand your company headquarters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Headquarter.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerGegner.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 20 computer opponents on huge procedurally generated maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sabotage your opponents or make agreements to prevent sabotage acts against your transport routes. Cooperate with them to provide cities as quickly as possible or buy unpleasant competitors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/KI-Gegner.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerStrom.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the power supply for cities and industries by delivering the required goods to power plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Strom.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerCities.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help cities grow by satisfying their needs for goods, food and luxury goods. Big cities provide more passengers which can be transported to nearby cities profitably. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/DynamischeStaedte.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerIndustrienundwaren.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transport 40 different goods between 39 different industries and numerous cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your station stock low to get a production bonus from industry buildings. Deliver machinery and tools to industry buildings to get a production boost for a short period of time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/IndustrienWachstum.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Head of department","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/929e4c77609448efd0fbcb8973a659ebba1c3784.jpg"},{"name":"District Manager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/54f18e3e116782b49f28f068939904d6ab2ae0ac.jpg"},{"name":"Managing Director","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/9cbdcfc258aeb2aafb7f3057ef015e9e4b4cc296.jpg"},{"name":"Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/9e3187e856e49ead8e21f0ce20c6772854422b67.jpg"},{"name":"Mayor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/aef199071839cabe7a0e92e54464bef06dc7636c.jpg"},{"name":"Technology level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/ed7b54d4a6870014e4a43fde809106fbcd66e96f.jpg"},{"name":"Minister of Finance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/5e5be850cd0801d964feb037c9c6a95ebed5aaf6.jpg"},{"name":"Research","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/5b4c1cb87da491d05f8509cabebf1f813bfd3162.jpg"},{"name":"Minister of Construction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/dbf3ed0f6d2cffe98888c98954e9b0071af4c033.jpg"},{"name":"Minister of Security","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/659920/b7843af32f329a5530c5e309459373c57e749795.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/659920?t=1741095764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/7e347ae3490ba34fb48178a094818f55d7f40c74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741095764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/56db98aae359da5549ea9cf6b064b7ad9cc36bcc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741095764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/56db98aae359da5549ea9cf6b064b7ad9cc36bcc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741095764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>STEAM WORKSHOP SUPPORT</h1><p>Update 1.13 adds Steam Workshop support to Transports. Create mods for Transports and share your creations with your friends and other players.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/TitelKelin600.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your transport empire on land, water and in the air! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerFahrzeuge.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build trucks, buses, ships, planes, trains, trams, maglevs, helicopter and zeppelins to transport goods and passengers between industry buildings and cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Renew your transport vehicles and replace them with better versions. Manufactories will offer you exclusive and special vehicle variants which will give you benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Fahrzeuge.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerForschung.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can research vehicle improvements to increase the efficiency of your vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Research.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerTycoon.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way up and reach the rank Tycoon. Unlock new gameplay features with each rank, finally become mayor of a city and apply for political offices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerPrestige.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you become the mayor of a city, you can build a prestige project and win the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Prestigeprojekt.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerHead.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a company headquarters foundation and gradually expand your company headquarters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Headquarter.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerGegner.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to 20 computer opponents on huge procedurally generated maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sabotage your opponents or make agreements to prevent sabotage acts against your transport routes. Cooperate with them to provide cities as quickly as possible or buy unpleasant competitors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/KI-Gegner.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerStrom.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the power supply for cities and industries by delivering the required goods to power plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/Strom.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerCities.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help cities grow by satisfying their needs for goods, food and luxury goods. Big cities provide more passengers which can be transported to nearby cities profitably. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/DynamischeStaedte.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/BannerIndustrienundwaren.png?t=1741095764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transport 40 different goods between 39 different industries and numerous cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your station stock low to get a production bonus from industry buildings. Deliver machinery and tools to industry buildings to get a production boost for a short period of time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/extras/IndustrienWachstum.gif?t=1741095764\" /></p>","developers":["Jens P. Behrens"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659920/header.jpg?t=1741095764","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 Jens P. Behrens 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul 